n Marvel Comics  it's not yet known to what extent that  Celestials will figure into the  narrative of the Eternals marvel's head  honcho Kevin Feige  has hinted that the flesh could be an  epoch spanning tens of thousands of  years so we may only get a look at them  in the form of some exposition on the  ancient history of the universe  as for the Eternals themselves we at  least have an idea of what a team that  will be featured in the movie will look  like thanks to marvel's recent panel at  San Diego comic-con 2019 the entire  primary cast was announced of the event  and it includes Richard Madden as Icarus  the leader of the Flex team of heroes  Angele  joleigh escena also known as Asura who  and the comments have been known to  consult with deviants Kumail Nanjiani as  Kingo who took up residence in Japan  thousands of years ago and learned the  ways of the samurai lurid red lavas  Macari an expert mechanical engineer and  speedster Brian Tyree Henry as Fastow's  a master weaponsmith salma hayek as a  jack who has spent most of her thousands  of earthly years in siberia finally  young Leah McHugh a sprite a trickster  who has forever stuck with the  appearance of a preteen child the  Eternals begins shooting next month so  hopefully it won't be too long before  some unofficial set photos of the stars  in costume arrive of course there will  probably be plenty of these interests  and little hints and revelations that  will come trickling out in the wake of  marvel's epic comic-con panel we'll keep  our eye out for them and keep you  up-to-date check out one of our newest  videos right here plus even more looper  videos but your favorite superheroes are  coming soon subscribe to our YouTube  channel and to the Bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]
 

